# Docker build context: an allowlist. Two images are built from here, the
# index (packages/dpp-overlay/Dockerfile) and the validator service
# (packages/dpp-profiles/validator-image/Dockerfile). Their context is the
# repository root because each depends on the workspace packages. Everything
# is excluded unless a Dockerfile copies it, so no local working material,
# specification, fixture or documentation can enter the context by accident.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!PATENTS
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/
!scripts/
scripts/*
!scripts/package-schemas.mjs
!contracts/
contracts/*
!contracts/*.schema.json

# Reinstalled and rebuilt inside the image, never copied.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
packages/dpp-core/schemas/
packages/dpp-protocol/schemas/

# Secrets never enter an image; configuration is environment only.
**/.env
**/.env.*
